[{"title":"槐阴","author":"刘敞","text":"都城广陌如绮分，绿槐左右结浮云。\n火轮东升又西没，倒影参差朝复曛。\n轻车重马谁家子，侧肩相逢密如蚁。\n共看择荫须臾间，可怜争道寻常里。\n下有沟水日夜流，年华视此俱悠悠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39178,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春阴","author":"刘敞","text":"楚山春阴谁复数，朝朝出云暮暮雨。\n高唐恍惚信有神，晦明代谢今犹古。\n蜀江渺渺水东流，苦雾凄雨翻似秋。\n日月高悬不可遇，眼看卑湿令人愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39179,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"桃源","author":"刘敞","text":"武陵溪水清无尘，武陵桃树花长春。\n会买渔舟谢宾客，来作武陵山下人。\n秦人洞府晋人溪，碧草红桃处处迷。\n流水至今堪怅望，问津从古失端倪。\n山川非复壶中见，鸡犬犹传云外啼。\n顾视人间真敝屣，为烦仙子托幽栖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39180,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和永叔十二韵","author":"刘敞","text":"爱公犹爱屋上乌，何况公家手种菊。\n忆昔重阳醉共赏，已落纱帽欢不足。\n谁令繁霜逼芳意，坐使严风卷馀馥。\n主人于此情不浅，上客方来强令束。\n马声玲珑摇玉环，屦綦参差破苔绿。\n重寻荒径忆五柳，因咏东篱憩茅屋。\n巳怜归鸟有真意，更觉晨风伤局促。\n引杯大釂倾玉壶，击节应非响乔木。\n物华瞬息暂入梦，世事蚊虻一过目。\n浮邱接袂当凤举，俗士歌骊真狗曲。\n衣冠顷来尘土变，形貌今者毛发秃。\n公诗乃使我忘老，逸调何由能继属。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39181,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"共城寄仲弟","author":"刘敞","text":"共城稻秧如黍禾，共城木少种竹多。\n熟闻迩来风土美，贫无置锥知奈何。\n百门苍翠太行麓，百泉清泠淇水澳。\n长安宦游跬步到，隐居鸡黍终年足。\n人生早念少游言，燕领莫矜飞食肉。\n即今囊空未果归，且为黎侯歌式微。\n寄声好在久良苦，异时自楫来迎汝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39182,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"田家行","author":"刘敞","text":"春耕高原不辞苦，晚岁离离满百亩。\n岂知输稻如输金，始信种田虚种黍。\n持黍易金入市行，粳稻踊贵黍价轻。\n十钟一石亦不惮，三时力农空自惊。\n去年岁荒食丰菽，今年岁丰弥不足。\n物理悠悠难豫谋，谁谓丰荒略相覆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39183,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荒田行","author":"刘敞","text":"大农弃田避征役，小农挈家就兵籍。\n良田茫茫少耕者，秋来雨止生荆棘。\n县官募兵有著令，募兵如率官有庆。\n从今无复官劝农，还逐鱼盐作亡命。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39184,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏作青瓷香球歌","author":"刘敞","text":"蓝田仙人采寒玉，蓝光照人瑩如烛。\n蟾肪淬刀昆吾石，信手镌花何委曲。\n濛濛夜气清且嫭，玉缕喷香如紫雾。\n天明人起朝云飞，彷佛疑成此中去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39185,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"樱桃花开留徐二饮","author":"刘敞","text":"晨晖照屋清露晞，樱桃花房开欲齐。\n繁花先得造物巧，不与众卉争高低。\n参差萼萼相照耀，恍惚满眼令人迷。\n鸟惊风过若无意，云起雪飞空满蹊。\n仰攀浓香俯玩影，应接不暇昏鸦栖。\n流光易失动壮士，斗酒相劳和天倪。\n浩歌直欲并日夜，醉耳不能分鼓鼙。\n人间出处未尝定，暂虽会合终当暌。\n子今跃马至万里，脱略尘土排云霓。\n豫知明年花复发，怅望君子无由携。\n少年且作后日意，更使封植惊淮西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39186,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"万卷生","author":"刘敞","text":"白头书生南国贤，读书万卷夜忘眠。\n陋巷箪瓢未曾饱，苦心独行竟谁怜。\n翻经遍穷十二等，陈力夐过三千年。\n莫笑青袍学士老，太平能颂连中弦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39187,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野望","author":"刘敞","text":"重阳去寥落，小雪碧苍茫。\n兽起骇枯草，鸟归横夕阳。\n薄云低引白，衰菊暗消黄。\n伫立何为久，怆人非故乡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39188,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芜城閒望二首 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"幽寻古城上，秋景日悽悽。\n落照映原没，阴虫当路啼。\n隋宫变芜蔓，楚分失端倪。\n自是伤亡国，非关醉眼迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39189,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"芜城閒望二首 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"春草忽更绿，荒城阴雾滋。\n风存鲍昭赋，秋益宋生悲。\n慨想秦兵出，传闻羽檄驰。\n江湖岁将晚，空羡逐鸱夷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夏晚","author":"刘敞","text":"闰馀时侯早，夏晚似新秋。\n月出空堂静，蝉鸣深树幽。\n健逢鹰学习，喜见火倾流。\n早晚凉飙起，重修白罽裘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"听钟","author":"刘敞","text":"陋巷客回辙，夕阳钟送秋。\n寒声满空谷，暝色下高楼。\n陡逐悲风起，微兼远角收。\n旅怀伤急景，听此愧淹留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野望","author":"刘敞","text":"江水不可越，扁舟浮夕阳。\n高秋露寥落，远树出毫芒。\n涧水清兼浊，山苗绿映黄。\n渔翁岂招隐，何待唱沧浪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观南戍士卒作乐","author":"刘敞","text":"箫鼓军中乐，旌旗岁晚过。\n激昂双剑舞，慷慨万人歌。\n睥睨荆衡小，腾凌虎兕多。\n北风随杀气，横绝洞庭波。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39194,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"闻圣俞移官霅上以便归养","author":"刘敞","text":"亲老不择禄，此心如古人。\n戴星捐吏事，戏綵过乡邻。\n若下开新酌，汀边咏白蘋。\n醉吟俱入手，亦未负青春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39195,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西域请平三首 其一","author":"刘敞","text":"西域请都护，崆峒献凯歌。\n两阶增羽籥，万里肃山河。\n甲第旃裘少，春宫苜蓿多。\n雌雄双匣剑，弃置欲如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39196,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西域请平三首 其二","author":"刘敞","text":"禦戎传上策，不战屈人兵。\n遂断匈奴臂，何须万里城。\n出车非远略，高枕得升平。\n战骨翻空死，吁嗟壮士名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39197,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西域请平三首 其三","author":"刘敞","text":"单于贪汉物，中国避天骄。\n赐予金银贵，行来玉帛遥。\n悲伤贾太傅，慷慨霍嫖姚。\n恸哭辞新第，英雄未可招。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39198,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪后登观风楼","author":"刘敞","text":"雪带郊原阔，城横碧玉齐。\n夕阳寒似落，远树望如迷。\n旅雁情更急，栖乌饥乱啼。\n强歌非郢客，竟日恋危梯。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39199,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"开竹下小径招君章","author":"刘敞","text":"翠竹生无数，萧萧一径新。\n阴繁催短日，地僻断飞尘。\n磐石兼容客，幽禽不避人。\n君能烂漫醉，当及七贤真。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39200,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠刁十八自蜀还乡昔与此君别于福唐","author":"刘敞","text":"瘴海三年别，巴山万里迷。\n相逢忻邂逅，即事恨睽携。\n梦减清江外，愁宽太白西。\n知君偃乡墅，已忘子规啼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39201,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送李监丞致仕还乡","author":"刘敞","text":"耄期吏隐倦，归去上恩荣。\n国子瞻师保，乡人庆父兄。\n挥金慰游旧，击壤傲升平。\n远笑吴门叟，何为变姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39202,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"怀陈州旧居所种桐寄黄翁","author":"刘敞","text":"忽忆南轩树，春风空复来。\n陈亡韶已矣，孔老凤悠哉。\n不作沟中断，应随爨下灰。\n旧居阡陌并，君到为徘徊。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39203,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荷华","author":"刘敞","text":"水国非人境，芙蕖五月秋。\n乱香清宿醉，浓艳破征愁。\n鱼戏都堪数，鸥飞绝自由。\n会须穷一赏，诘曲任扁舟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39204,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七月二日","author":"刘敞","text":"西风入庭树，天气飒然秋。\n细雨才成润，高云淡不流。\n平分感一叶，远兴忆扁舟。\n蟋蟀何须急，羁人始欲留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39205,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋雨所居漏湿","author":"刘敞","text":"皇天不爱物，风雨害秋成。\n未恨泥涂辱，端忧柱石倾。\n淹留惊岁宴，坚卧怅鸡鸣。\n吾道还如此，商歌天未明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39206,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"刘敞","text":"采萧逼晚岁，飞雨度高云。\n暝色空窗见，秋声坠叶闻。\n过萤低似灭，远岫望如分。\n蟋蟀悲虚织，轻丝竞欲棼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39207,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"始凉","author":"刘敞","text":"北风吹过雨，晚景留新秋。\n高卧来一笑，如焚宽百忧。\n精神露鹰隼，意气激骅骝。\n自觉亦飞动，江湖思远游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39208,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"重到谢氏园亭寄裴博士俊叔王主簿宗杰时裴往淮南王出京师","author":"刘攽","text":"徘徊远林下，幽草为谁芳。\n前日同游客，今朝俱异乡。\n东风虽淡荡，陈迹似凄凉。\n何用江千里，春心故易伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39209,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送晁殿丞佥判郑州","author":"刘敞","text":"世德缁衣美，天伦玉树温。\n于君如旧识，赠子欲奚言。\n东里贤能宅，成皋战伐原。\n从容访耆老，遗迹尚多存。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39210,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"檀州","author":"刘敞","text":"穷谷回看尽，孤城平望遥。\n市声衙日集，海盖午时消。\n冠带才通汉，山川更入辽。\n春风解冰雪，最觉马蹄骄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39211,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雨中闻钟","author":"刘敞","text":"疏钟不隔雨，迢递入重城。\n倦客未能寐，归禽初不惊。\n霏微通暮色，飒沓隐秋声。\n帘幕鲜风起，明朝应早晴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39212,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"珍簟","author":"刘敞","text":"珍簟平铺水，珠帘半捲风。\n劳生高枕里，多事剧棋中。\n性僻非朝隐，民淳赖岁丰。\n翛然对松菊，但觉讼庭空。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39213,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"蝉","author":"刘敞","text":"微躯定谁恨，清啸不知劳。\n屈宋悲秋苦，夷齐卧隐高。\n风林含咽绝，露叶动萧骚。\n何必催摇落，人今已二毛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39214,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临雨亭","author":"刘敞","text":"秋至感人思，登临成惘然。\n浮云帝乡外，落日古城边。\n归雁声相别，幽花色可怜。\n名山负独往，触物见徂年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39215,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"同梅二十五饮永叔家观所抄集近事","author":"刘敞","text":"陶公一亩宅，尤爱北窗风。\n心远地成僻，客来樽不空。\n观书太史氏，全性市门翁。\n予亦何为者，于兹清赏同。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39216,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"伏波","author":"刘敞","text":"伏波志慷慨，南涉武溪深。\n铜柱功一跌，壶倾悲至今。\n吾闻威四海，亦有失前禽。\n试察两阶舞，应如丹浦心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39217,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"客有遗予注辇国鹦鹉素服黄冠语音甚清慧此国在海西距中州四十一万里舟行半道过西王母三年乃远番禺也","author":"刘敞","text":"四十万里外，孤舟天与邻。\n应誇王母使，更遇越裳人。\n素质宜姑射，黄冠即羽民。\n那将笼禽比，萧洒绝埃尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39218,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九月十四日于雍熙院为舅氏斋设作","author":"刘敞","text":"他时伤远别，渭北遽成悲。\n今作终天恨，悠悠奈我思。\n平生华屋处，回首不胜悲。\n寂寞西州路，何堪再到时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39219,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晦日","author":"刘敞","text":"是月佳游胜，兹辰旧俗同。\n会须陶一醉，相与送诸穷。\n江柳参差绿，林花点染红。\n春期犹大半，作意竞东风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39220,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新蝉","author":"刘敞","text":"五月微阴始，鸣蝉高树幽。\n倚风偏送晓，迎露欲先秋。\n孤管清兼浊，幺弦断复留。\n年华自当尔，羁客浪多愁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39221,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和江学士闻蝉","author":"刘敞","text":"微阴变潜律，浓雾引疏音。\n时化能无感，清吟独有心。\n萧条映落日，断续响中林。\n秋风忽满眼，叹息岁华深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39222,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄隐直","author":"刘敞","text":"避人非故土，带郭喜幽居。\n浅俗情多畏，新知意尚疏。\n负暄胜构火，汲井足滋疏。\n二物关身外，悠悠谢里闾。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39223,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄袁陟","author":"刘敞","text":"巫峡行云外，春江落日边。\n隔年鸡黍具，万里孝廉船。\n远道比何若，相思长渺然。\n郢中轻白雪，逸响待君传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39224,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范佑之","author":"刘敞","text":"吾子世罕识，他时醒亦狂。\n由来韵高逸，固自得轩昂。\n阮籍哭道路，接舆歌凤凰。\n之人亦岂病，相叹不能忘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39225,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄王二十","author":"刘敞","text":"累累烦书札，悠悠感别离。\n平生义缱绻，相忆路逶迤。\n羁旅老将至，江湖天一涯。\n佯狂人事绝，乘兴尔难期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39226,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄苏州张六","author":"刘敞","text":"西风入帘幕，游子念江湖。\n丹橘垂珠实，肥鱼荐玉腴。\n他时肯招隐，快意欲乘桴。\n物色烦相候，佯狂兴不无。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39227,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄隐直","author":"刘敞","text":"俱为异乡客，似伴老僧禅。\n虚室矜生白，时流笑草玄。\n岁寒差自若，生理直翛然。\n无术能乘兴，苍茫欲雪天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39228,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄张献臣","author":"刘敞","text":"缔交从若水，百里绝相过。\n平日相离索，期年见揣摩。\n从容席上客，清绝郢中歌。\n拟属阳春和，伊予独在薖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39229,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄张晋卿时弃官还家","author":"刘敞","text":"闻道新安尉，清羸只自如。\n归来陶令赋，养性子真书。\n情在交游厚，心于仕进疏。\n人忧弃妻子，独入剡中居。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39230,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄范佑之","author":"刘敞","text":"范子三年别，长安北望深。\n相知非势利，寄信各浮沉。\n勇锐百夫敌，轩昂万里心。\n何时杀群贼，自取肘边金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39231,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄梅山阴","author":"刘敞","text":"县与吴门近，居家识旧游。\n山回江表尽，水入鉴中流。\n胜事皆高古，诗怀易满眸。\n春风花又发，能寄北人不。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39232,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄苏颂兄弟","author":"刘敞","text":"秋风生眼前，客子思悠然。\n羁旅独无友，别离私自怜。\n赋甘伧父诮，诗许俗人传。\n他日梁王客，偏怀太子贤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39233,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄因甫","author":"刘敞","text":"昔别大梁下，至今三岁馀。\n岂无万里使，不寄一行书。\n风俗与时薄，交游于义疏。\n知君淡如水，非是故忘予。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39234,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄张仲谋","author":"刘敞","text":"张也真吾友，今年见老成。\n自彊虽不息，积习亦诸兄。\n曲讲闻师泛，题诗使客惊。\n莫如班定远，投笔笑诸生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39235,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"和直孺夜凉","author":"刘敞","text":"急雨逐云过，微风吹月生。\n寥寥天宇阔，粲粲葛衣轻。\n展转漏将永，昭回河正横。\n秋槎旧有信，忽忆泛沧瀛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39236,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送楘州王学士","author":"刘敞","text":"春草碧将歇，江南莺乱飞。\n王孙去有适，綵服粲生辉。\n古郡富山水，斯人歌海沂。\n惟应布宽诏，谈笑树风徽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39237,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"素屏","author":"刘敞","text":"简拙违时好，丹青谢尔工。\n坐看居士室，想见古人风。\n当户月常入，过春霜未融。\n物情忌太白，少自晦尘中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39238,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"城楼望春","author":"刘敞","text":"高楼新雪后，春意已端倪。\n绕石泉声急，围城柳色齐。\n滞流贪适兴，幽僻懒招携。\n旧种桃千树，春游豫恐迷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39239,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送邵武张学士","author":"刘敞","text":"待诏勤穿履，承明厌直庐。\n一麾从此去，千骑上头居。\n岁事畬田早，风谣鴂舌馀。\n班春急乘传，知不为鲈鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39240,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"野思","author":"刘敞","text":"野色行行远，春辉树树繁。\n看花频落帽，听鸟久忘言。\n遣兴惟诗句，开怀独酒樽。\n谁能顾名利，终岁不窥园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39241,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访杨异寺丞","author":"刘敞","text":"三径向松菊，始疑元亮居。\n但多柳五树，复对隼双旟。\n相识是倾盖，剧谈能起予。\n樵苏不用爨，耳目且清虚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39242,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄寺丞风雨中见过","author":"刘敞","text":"节物重阳晚，风云万里阴。\n君来慰孤愤，语次豁愁心。\n名下如旧识，人间仍陆沈。\n独醒感庭菊，萧索万黄金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39243,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送洛南周寺丞","author":"刘敞","text":"不知商洛道，空慕紫芝歌。\n从事老将至，送君情独多。\n双凫尚方去，驷马故乡过。\n想见挥弦乐，春风初扇和。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":39244,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]